<title>NIGERIA: TABLE-May &amp; Baker Nigeria raises half-yr profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE-May &amp; Baker Nigeria raises half-yr profit.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year result for healthcare firm May &amp; Baker Nigeria Plc to end-June 1997. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				     1997	 1996</p>
<p>    Turnover		     317.7  vs  221.9</p>
<p>    Profit before taxation     38.2 vs   22.2</p>
<p>    Taxation			 11.4 vs    6.6</p>
<p>    Profit after taxation	26.7 vs   15.5</p>
<p>($1 = 83.20 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
